abstract: >-
  Replication package for the Empirical Software Engineering manuscript
  Measuring Reference Integrity in Coding-Agent Instruction Files: An
  Audited Longitudinal Study. Contains frozen observational exports,
  audit materials, independent human validation labels, claim-to-evidence
  mappings, GFC filter outputs, exploratory runtime-probe ledgers,
  protocols, and regeneration scripts. Package version 1.2.0 aligns public
  metadata and documentation with the EMSE manuscript without recomputing
  or altering frozen scientific evidence. Science freeze date: 2026-07-03;
  validation extension: 2026-07-31. After Zenodo archives this GitHub
  release, replace the preferred citation DOI with the minted v1.2.0
  version DOI (concept DOI remains 10.5281/zenodo.21711431).
